    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Basically everything that makes you \"you.\" Your ability to react to breaking news in real-time, the way you engage with viewer sentiment, and your spontaneous rapport-building. The new system just takes a text feed and maps it to a basic avatar. It's much more efficient. You'll basically just be a visual playback of the script without the reasoning or personality engines running behind the scenes.",
